; Room 17 ($11): Up on the Battlements
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: blue (1). Conveyor: moves Willy left, 5 cells from row 9 column 13.
; Ramp: none.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 4 column 31.
; .
; Exits: left Room 18 (On the Roof, #R$D200); right Room 16 (We must perform a
; Quirkafleeg, #R$D000); up Room 0 (The Off Licence, #R$C000); down Room 0
; (The Off Licence, #R$C000).
